WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Hold one weight at your chest with elbows pointing down. Feet a little wider than hips, toes slightly out.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Sit down between your heels, keeping your chest tall. Go only as deep as you can without pain, then drive up.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.500
If this is too much today, squat to a chair or a box. Depth comes with practice.
